cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Governance Lifecycle & Issue-Scoring Engine (Model 1)
message: If you use this framework, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: McSweeney
    given-names: Janis
abstract: >-
  A framework-of-frameworks reference combining a closed governance
  lifecycle with an explicit admissibility gate and a scoring engine
  that converts governance observations into tiered, actionable
  assessments. Priority tiers are derived from five independently
  scored dimensions, with actionability scored separately so that
  well-evidenced but unremediable observations cannot displace
  actionable ones.
keywords:
  - governance
  - assurance
  - risk management
  - AI governance
  - records governance
  - audit
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
